==History==
2017
*The Bandit was once available in the [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Bandit Draft Challenge]] which started on 17/3/2017. In this [[Tournament|challenge]], gameplay was similar to a regular Draft Challenge, except that one of the players was able to choose who would use the Bandit. If the player achieved 12 wins, they obtained the Bandit early.
*The Bandit [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 24/3/2017.
*On 12/6/2017, the [[Version History#June 2017 Update (12/6/2017)|June 2017 Update]], decreased the time required for charging her dash to 0.8 seconds (from 1 second).
*On 13/6/2017, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (13/6/2017)|maintenance break]], increased the Bandit's hitpoints by 4%. This was supposed to happen the previous day in the mentioned balance changes, but it did not make it to the game. This got fixed.
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], fixed a bug where she dashed a shorter distance than she normally should have.
2018
*On 12/2/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/2/2018)|Balance Update]], decreased her minimum dash range to 3.5 tiles (from 4 tiles).
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], made a small change to the Bandit's card description.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards start at Level 9 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 5). It also made the Bandit immune to damage while dashing, instead of untargetable.
2019
*On 1/4/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/4/2019)|Balance Update]], decreased the Bandit's hitpoints by 4%.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Bandit's card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], fixed a bug where the Bandit's dash would continue after the timer reaches zero. It also moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Bandit from Jungle Arena to Rascal's Hideout.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 30/3/2022, the [[Version History#Miner%20Update%20(30/3/2022)|Miner Update]], fixed an issue where the Bandit would become untargetable before dashing. It also fixed an issue where the Bandit could be damaged at the end of her dash.
*On 15/12/2022, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (15/12/2022)|maintenance break]], fixed various damage inconsistencies with the damage of the Bandit's dash.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor%20Update%20(13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], fixed a bug where Bandit could not hit targets across the river with her dash.
2025
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], decreased the Bandit's hitpoints by 0.11%, and increased her damage and dash damage by 0.51%. It also allowed a dashing Bandit to be affected by [[Royal Chef]].

